notes: >-
  Code is Apache-2.0; data (RunRecords, corpus, ground truth, grades) is
  CC BY 4.0 (see LICENSE-DATA); pre-registration prompts and forms are CC0.
  This is one versioned study release. The comparative campaign evaluated
  mlt-stack 1.0.0rc1. After its audit exposed a fail-open result-state defect,
  the study checked the successor 1.0.3-derived implementation on the frozen
  canonical conditions to determine whether blocking or insufficient
  specifications route to non-executable states.
references:
  - type: article
    title: "MANDATE: Tolerance-Based Task Specification with Tamper-Evident Provenance for LLM Agents, and What Its Own Audit Trail Revealed"
    authors:
